rt of nature a POKéMON would have if it favored enfeebling its opponents and chipping away slowly.\nI'd be surprised if it was a LAX nature.\nBut, nah, that can't be right."]},{"at":[18,10],"source_script":"BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_EventScript_Man","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_MAN_3","source_id":4,"local_id":4,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_WANDER_AROUND","elevation":0,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["Hmm…\nIt appears that the nature of POKéMON and the moves that they have been taught are the keys to battle here.\nTo be more precise, it's how well the moves match the nature of the POKéMON.\nIf your POKéMON is in trouble and unable to live up to its potential, you may need to examine how well its moves match its nature."]},{"at":[2,10],"source_script":"BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_EventScript_Beauty","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_BEAUTY","source_id":5,"local_id":5,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_WANDER_AROUND","elevation":0,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["My POKéMON is usually very docile.\nBut when it's in a BATTLE HALL, it sometimes seems to become transformed into something wicked!\nIt becomes totally intimidating. It's shocking, even."]},{"at":[19,6],"source_script":"BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_EventScript_DoublesAttendant","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_EXPERT_M","source_id":6,"local_id":6,"source_local":"LOCALID_PALACE_ATTENDANT_DOUBLES","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN","elevation":0,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民"}],"objects":[{"at":[2,7],"source_script":"BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_EventScript_ShowSinglesResults","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":""},{"at":[16,7],"source_script":"BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_EventScript_ShowDoublesResults","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":""},{"at":[10,4],"source_script":"BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_EventScript_RulesBoar